    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0197",
      "reading_order": 246,
      "section": "5. Notice on the Electric and NC Devices",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.219514,
        "t": 674.4146479999999,
        "r": 307.56735,
        "b": 648.5630369281769
      },
      "content": "Do not give a shock on the NC device and the Electric Control Panel, etc."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0198",
      "reading_order": 247,
      "section": "5. Notice on the Electric and NC Devices",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.21951400000002,
        "t": 555.4351640000001,
        "r": 307.61745000000025,
        "b": 461.5437449281769
      },
      "content": "In case of the power cable, use it with the same  thickness  provided  in  this  manual, and do not use longer cable than needed. When the  power  cable  has  to  be  passed the floor,  be  sure  to  prevent  it  from  being damaged by chips."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0199",
      "reading_order": 248,
      "section": "5. Notice on the Electric and NC Devices",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.21951400000002,
        "t": 453.43557200000015,
        "r": 307.5893939999998,
        "b": 376.5841649281769
      },
      "content": "In case of test operation, check the parameter of NC device is set properly with our instructor attended. Also, do not change  any  parameters  except  one  for backlash."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0200",
      "reading_order": 249,
      "section": "5. Notice on the Electric and NC Devices",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 92.219514,
        "t": 300.4347680000001,
        "r": 335.7976980000006,
        "b": 223.58336092817672
      },
      "content": "The  Electric  Control  Panel  is  sealed  to  prevent the  ambient  air  from  entering.  Do  not  open  the door of Control Panel for long while applying the power. Direct ray of sun or flash of camera may result in damage of the part."
    },
